#: templates/views/pages/conceptual-model.htm:31
msgid ""
"Most heritage databases record what an object <em>is</em>. ManuSpectrum "
"records what <em>happened to it</em> — and who said so. Every measurement is "
"an event with a date, an instrument and an operator. Every interpretation is "
"stored separately from the observation that supports it. That separation is "
"what lets you re-read someone else's conclusion — and disagree with it."
